participants: Instance, Registry, Caller
Instance -> Registry: register payments at 10.0.3.7:8080
Instance -> Registry: heartbeat (every 5 s)
Caller -> Registry: where is payments?
Registry --> Caller: 10.0.3.7:8080, 10.0.3.9:8080 (healthy)
Caller -> Instance: call 10.0.3.7:8080 (client-side balancing)
note over Instance, Registry: no heartbeat for 15 s: the registry removes the instance
